 applets/wncklet/Makefile.am         |  2 +
 applets/wncklet/meson.build         |  2 +-
 applets/wncklet/wayland-workspace.c | 99 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 3 files changed, 93 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

